  "title": {
    "zh": "不断电负载窗口",
    "en": "Unbroken Power Window"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "禁用时段 · 固定宽度 · 最高总负载",
    "en": "Blocked slots · Fixed width · Highest total load"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "loads 是每格时段的净负载，可能是负数。选一个连续 width 格的窗口，不能含 blocked 中任一时段编号。宽度为正，编号从 0 开始。返回 [窗口起点, 窗口内负载之和]，总负载大者优先，并列就选较早的起点。没有符合条件的窗口时返回 None。",
    "en": "loads gives the net load of each time slot and may contain negative values. Pick exactly width consecutive slots without including an index in blocked. Width is positive and indices start at zero. Return [start index, total load]. Prefer the highest total, breaking ties by the earliest start. Return None if no window qualifies."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "functionName": "choose_power_window",
  "helpers": [
    "prefix_totals"
  ],
  "starterCode": "def choose_power_window(loads, width, blocked):\n    pass\n",
  "solutionCode": "from algorithms import prefix_totals\n\ndef choose_power_window(loads, width, blocked):\n    totals = prefix_totals(loads)\n    best = None\n    for start in range(len(loads) - width + 1):\n        end = start + width\n        clear = True\n        for closed in blocked:\n            if start <= closed and closed < end:\n                clear = False\n                break\n        if clear:\n            score = totals[end] - totals[start]\n            if best is None or score > best[1]:\n                best = [start, score]\n    return best\n",
